{room, key=multiplexer_home, name=Multiplexer
    {attrib, output=false, tags=tested }
    {attrib, tags=navigation
        output={@
enter portal 1
enter portal 2
enter portal 3
enter portal 4
enter portal 5
        }
    }

    {enter_message
        output={@

You are in a room that is arrayed with square portals along the walls.
You actually know where you are!

The Multiplexer.

Each portal dives into lower level code within Shellspace. It is impossible
to know what exactly awaits beyond each portal. You've read forum threads
about this place. Hobbyists build out their own spaces here. Beyond the
view of those who own Shellspace. It is the darkweb's darkweb.


There are 5 portals.

You can examine them by number.

        }
        
        {logic, name=Multiplexer Home tested, tags=!_test
            logic={@
                ?[self]((tested)) = 'true'
            }
        }
    }

    {look
        {message
            output={@

You look around...
You are in a room that is arrayed with square portals along the walls.

The Multiplexer.

Each portal dives into lower level code within Shellspace. It is impossible
to know what exactly awaits beyond each portal. It is the darkweb's darkweb.


There are 5 portals.

You can examine them by number.

            }
        }
    }



    // 8 bit
    {x_01
        {message
            output={@
The first portal glows with bright primary colors. It flickers and glitches
a bit.

            }
        }
    }
    // IntFiction
    {x_02
        {message
            output={@
The second portal is dark.
White text flows up across its surface. You are unable to read what it says
though. It is passing by too quickly.

            }
        }
    }
    // Anomaly
    {x_03
        {message
            output={@
The third portal seems cloudy. The hint of a face flickers in and out of view
every now and then something seems to be... off however.

            }
        }
    }
    // Labyrinth
    {x_04
        {message
            output={@
The fourth portal seems to be looking in on an endless passage.
The walls are rough stone.

            }
        }
    }
    // Console
    {x_05
        {message
            output={@
The fifth portal is solid black. In the top left area, a small white
line is flickering on and off.

            }
        }
    }



    {inject, logic=/nav.inj }
    {inject, logic=/look.inj }


    {input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((x_portal_01))
        {act, logic=x_01, tags=!_type|room }
    }
    {input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((x_portal_02))
        {act, logic=x_02, tags=!_type|room }
    }
    {input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((x_portal_03))
        {act, logic=x_03, tags=!_type|room }
    }
    {input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((x_portal_04))
        {act, logic=x_04, tags=!_type|room }
    }
    {input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((x_portal_05))
        {act, logic=x_05, tags=!_type|room }
    }


    {input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((go_portal_01))
        {move, logic=portal_01, tags=[player]
            output={@
You enter the first portal...


            }
        }
    }
    {input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((go_portal_02))
        {move, logic=portal_02, tags=[player]
            output={@
You enter the second portal...


            }
        }
    }
    {input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((go_portal_03))
        {move, logic=portal_03, tags=[player]
            output={@
You enter the third portal...


            }
        }
    }
    {input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((go_portal_04))
        {move, logic=portal_04, tags=[player]
            output={@
You enter the fourth portal...


            }
        }
    }
    {input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((go_portal_05))
        {move, logic=portal_05, tags=[player]
            output={@
You enter the fifth portal...


            }
        }
    }
}
